Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:28:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] serve: requests keep their usual slot (lanes), the paused
 part waits in a reserved top-row slot, a paused read lets the whole short
 burst go first, cached new-token estimates (opt-in STRATA_YIELD_SHORT=N)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
